Job Description We are seeking a skilled Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET) to join our dynamic team. The ideal candidate will have 3-5 years of relevant work experience and possess strong expertise in API and web testing. As an SDET, you will play a crucial role in ensuring the quality and reliability of our software products through the design, implementation, and execution of automated test cases. Requirements Key

RESPONSIBILITIES:
Develop and maintain automated test scripts using Java Script or Type Script-based tools and libraries. Design, implement, and execute comprehensive test plans and test cases for Web or Mobile applications. Perform web automation testing using Playwright to ensure application functionality, performance, and reliability. Perform API testing and automation to identify functional issues early in the test cycle. Collaborate with software developers and QA engineers to identify, track, and resolve defects. Participate in Agile development processes, including sprint planning, daily stand-ups, and sprint reviews. Continuously research and implement best practices in test automation and quality assurance. Contribute to the improvement of testing processes, frameworks, and methodologies. Qualifications and Skills: Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field. 3–5 years of experience in software development and testing. Proficiency in Java Script or Type Script programming. Hands-on experience in web and API testing. Strong experience with Playwright is mandatory. Solid understanding of software testing principles, methodologies, and best practices. Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills. Strong communication and collaboration abilities. Ability to work effectively in a fast-paced, Agile environment. I'm interested View all jobs Visit website Powered by {{criteria Index}} {{field}} {{captialize(condition)}} ( ) {{cx Prop Help Text}} {{cx Prop Field.consent_details.description}} {{record.Posting_Title}} {{record.Posting_Title}} {{record.Posting_Title}} {{candidate.Email}} {{top Message}} Job Details {{top Message}} previous next {{title}} {{score}}% Job Description {{unescape(sanitize HTML(description HTML))}} {{message}} Step {{cur Step In Mandatory Sec Prompt}}/{{total Num Of Steps In Mandatory Sec Prompt}} For privacy and security purposes, please go through the following points and provide consent. Accept Decline {{get I18n("zr.careers.p